Portanto, considero válido expor-lhe as três diretrizes mais aceitas ao redor do mundo:
● Official positions – International society for clinical densitometry (ISCD) – 2019.
● Clinician’s guide to prevention and treatment of osteoporosis – National osteoporosis foundation (NOF) – 2014.
